{"id": "1551547330510069814", "channel_id": "1551547330510069814", "author_id": "1470253170209853632", "author_name": "morimensstaff03", "content": "守密人你好：\n       弥萨格大学校务处将于9月21日18:55(UTC+8) 进行校内设施修复，更新完成后您将得到通知，重新进入游戏。对于更新可能给大家带来的不便，我们会准备一份补给物资以示歉意。祝大家调查顺利！ \n       更新内容中，末尾标注 ☆ 的事项来自社区各位守密人的问题反馈。感谢各位守密人的耐心与帮助！\n  \n【补给物资】\n在线维护补偿：银芯×50\n  \n【领取条件】\n领取时间截至2026年10月5日23:59。请记得及时前往邮箱领取补给物资哦。  \n \n【更新内容】\n\n问题修复\n● 修复了「通讯器」中，完成唤醒体「负誓·奥吉尔」的「最终法则」通讯对话的奖励错误的问题。修复后为「原初灵核」×1，与其他唤醒体一致。此前已经完成该对话的守密人，将在更新后 48 小时内收到补发「原初灵核」×1 奖励的邮件。\n● 修复了唤醒体「负誓·奥吉尔」和「卡拉布」的档案中，某些情况下「相位对弈」对话会被错误地解锁的问题。修复后，此前已错误解锁的相关「相位对弈」对话将恢复到正常的未解锁状态。\n● 修复了「弥萨格商店-限时礼盒」中，唤醒体「负誓·奥吉尔」的「灵核固化礼盒」系列礼盒结束倒计时与礼盒说明会错误地重叠的问题。\n● 修复了「幕间演习-无光之境」中，查看「奖励预览」会卡住的问题。\n● 修复了「活动」中，玩法活动「倘若荣光不复」在未选中状态下，页签顶部亮度过高的问题。", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T10:55:09.949000+00:00", "thread_id": "1551547330510069814", "reactions": [{"emoji": "🐘", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "attachments": [{"id": "1551547330967117894", "filename": "screenshot_2026-04-29_17-10-25.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 801524, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1551547330510069814/1551547330967117894/screenshot_2026-04-29_17-10-25.png?ex=6ab25e8e&is=6ab10d0e&hm=d8d6ab032acd89bfa75eed60e839b1dbdbf3a4af24de6c047d41320ba9fc266d&"}], "thread_title": "V2.6.1.1 在线维护公告", "forum_channel_id": "1181135756958371881", "is_thread_starter": true}
{"id": "1551547393445597237", "channel_id": "1551547330510069814", "author_id": "1470253170209853632", "author_name": "morimensstaff03", "content": "**V2.6.1.1 Online Maintenance Announcement**\n\nDear Keeper,\nThe Mythag Administration Office will conduct campus facility maintenance on September 21, 2026 at 18:55(UTC+8) . You will be notified once the update is complete and you can re-enter the game. As an apology for any inconvenience caused by the update, we will provide a supply package. Wishing everyone a successful investigation!\nIn this update, items marked with ☆ at the end are based on feedback from Keepers in the community. Thank you all, Keepers, for your patience and support!\n   \n[Compensation]\nOnline Maintenance Compensation: Silver×50\n   \n[Claim Conditions]\nThe claiming time ends on October 5, 2026 at 23:59. Please remember to go to your mailox in time to claim the supply materials.\n   \n[Update Content]\n\nBug Fixes\n● Fixed an issue in the \"Communicator\" where the reward for completing the \"Absolute Axiom\" communication dialogue with the Awakener \"Ogier: Oathbound\" was incorrect. After the fix, the reward is \"Gnosis Primer\" ×1, consistent with other Awakeners. Keepers who have already completed this dialogue will receive a mail with the retroactive reward of \"Gnosis Primer\" ×1 within 48 hours after the update.\n● Fixed an issue where \"Traphase\" dialogues in the profiles of Awakeners \"Ogier: Oathbound\" and \"Caraboo\" could be incorrectly unlocked in certain situations. After this fix, any previously incorrectly unlocked \"Traphase\" dialogues will be restored to their normal Locked state.\n● Fixed an issue in the \"Mythag Shop-Limited-Time Giftbox\" where the countdown timer and the giftbox description for the \"Spirit Core Giftbox\" series of the Awakener \"Ogier: Oathbound\" would incorrectly overlap.\n● Fixed an issue in \"Interlude-Lightless Realm\" where viewing \"Reward Preview\" would cause the game to freeze.\n● Fixed an issue in \"Events\" where the gameplay event \"Should Glory Fade\" had overly bright tab headers when not selected.", "timestamp": "2026-09-21T10:55:24.954000+00:00", "thread_id": "1551547330510069814", "thread_title": "V2.6.1.1 在线维护公告", "forum_channel_id": "1181135756958371881"}
